# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so
# the set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# `plow` owns every chat fact this plugin reads or writes -- the grant, the
# roster, `trusted`, contact labels. `plow-hermes-agent` bakes this tree into
# the image and pins it; `agent-mgr` pins and installs it by SHA for the Docker
# fleet. Both decide where these files land, so a change to the installed set
# has to be read against them.

plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent
plow-pbc/agent-mgr
